{
    "title": "Bicycle Rickshaw Driving Games",
    "description": "If you love to ride Bicycle Indian bicycle then this bicycle riding simulator is just for you. You can earn money while doing something you love, doesn\u2019t it sound like dream job? You can provide pick and drop services to the local passengers by driving your very own Bicycle Indian Bicycle taxi riding simulator. Time to enjoy the ride with Bicycle Tuk Tuk Auto Rickshaw : New Driving Games. Let's have fun with unique rickshaw driving and transport game. Bicycle Tuk Tuk cycle Richshaw is a typical indian rickshaw bicycle also famous all over the world. Drive on the city roads, pick n drop passengers and have fun. Play with auto game and enjoy driving with rickshaw games. The amazing Indian style Cycle Rickshaw wala game.\r\n\r\nStart your adventure with our bicycle rickshaw games! Cycle games have never been so much fun before this rickshaw games. Our New Game 'Bicycle Rickshaw Taxi Driving Simulator' will test your bike riding skills in which you will provide pick and drop service to city passengers from one place to another. \r\nHows does it feel to drive the amazing bicycle rickshaw, typical Indian tuk tuk rickshaw wala game. In this new world of 2023 with the amazing driving simulator games out their, this is a brand new way to entertain yourself by driving Indian rickshaw on the roads to pick n drop passengers.You can ride your fast Bicycle Rickshaw Indian bike on city roads to feel the thrill of fast city bike driving on your Bicycle Indian bicycle passenger taxi. You will be given certain tasks to pick and drop your loyal local city passengers to their destinations which will be marked. You will be further guided by a mini map on the top left of your phone screen through a red dot that will mark the destination of your city bike passenger.\r\n\r\n\r\nFeatures:\r\nYou will be provided with a mini map to guide you to your Indian bicycle taxi passengers and drop them to their destination.\r\nGreat and realistic sound effects to make your BMX taxi Bicycle riding experience even better and smooth.\r\nCool and realistic graphics and visuals will make your bike riding experience even more realistic.\r\nPractice your bicycle rickshaw taxi riding skills and paddle fast to reach the destination as soon as you can so that your passengers do not get late!\r\nBe careful and make sure you make it to your destination on your Bicycle taxi in time as there is a time limit.\r\nProvide Pick and drop services on your Bicycle rickshaw City taxi bicycle to your loyal cycle passengers.\r\nMake loyal customers by providing them the best pick and drop bicycle taxi services.\r\n\r\nDownload & enjoy bicycle pick & drop game and entertain your city taxi bike driving passengers. Become a bicycle rickshaw driver boy in our cycle bike game.",
    "descriptionHTML": "If you love to ride Bicycle Indian bicycle then this bicycle riding simulator is just for you. You can earn money while doing something you love, doesn\u2019t it sound like dream job? You can provide pick and drop services to the local passengers by driving your very own Bicycle Indian Bicycle taxi riding simulator. Time to enjoy the ride with Bicycle Tuk Tuk Auto Rickshaw : New Driving Games. Let&#39;s have fun with unique rickshaw driving and transport game. Bicycle Tuk Tuk cycle Richshaw is a typical indian rickshaw bicycle also famous all over the world. Drive on the city roads, pick n drop passengers and have fun. Play with auto game and enjoy driving with rickshaw games. The amazing Indian style Cycle Rickshaw wala game.<br><br>Start your adventure with our bicycle rickshaw games! Cycle games have never been so much fun before this rickshaw games. Our New Game &#39;Bicycle Rickshaw Taxi Driving Simulator&#39; will test your bike riding skills in which you will provide pick and drop service to city passengers from one place to another. <br>Hows does it feel to drive the amazing bicycle rickshaw, typical Indian tuk tuk rickshaw wala game. In this new world of 2023 with the amazing driving simulator games out their, this is a brand new way to entertain yourself by driving Indian rickshaw on the roads to pick n drop passengers.You can ride your fast Bicycle Rickshaw Indian bike on city roads to feel the thrill of fast city bike driving on your Bicycle Indian bicycle passenger taxi. You will be given certain tasks to pick and drop your loyal local city passengers to their destinations which will be marked. You will be further guided by a mini map on the top left of your phone screen through a red dot that will mark the destination of your city bike passenger.<br><br><br>Features:<br>You will be provided with a mini map to guide you to your Indian bicycle taxi passengers and drop them to their destination.<br>Great and realistic sound effects to make your BMX taxi Bicycle riding experience even better and smooth.<br>Cool and realistic graphics and visuals will make your bike riding experience even more realistic.<br>Practice your bicycle rickshaw taxi riding skills and paddle fast to reach the destination as soon as you can so that your passengers do not get late!<br>Be careful and make sure you make it to your destination on your Bicycle taxi in time as there is a time limit.<br>Provide Pick and drop services on your Bicycle rickshaw City taxi bicycle to your loyal cycle passengers.<br>Make loyal customers by providing them the best pick and drop bicycle taxi services.<br><br>Download &amp; enjoy bicycle pick &amp; drop game and entertain your city taxi bike driving passengers. Become a bicycle rickshaw driver boy in our cycle bike game.",
